</code></pre> <pre><code>MobileCore.track(action: "site_error", data: ["errorType": "server", "errorCode": "503"])
</code></pre> Key What it holds Examples <code>errorType</code> Kind of error. Use the agreed list <code>page not found</code>, <code>server</code>, <code>payment</code>, <code>timeout</code> <code>errorCode</code> A short code. Never the message text, which may contain personal data <code>404</code>, <code>503</code>

